values ('35420810-b051-4517-8442-44d2b3d44068', 'c229572b-1c0d-446e-8c7c-f05b2852bb92', '{"html": "<p><strong>You\u2019re not burned out. You\u2019re disconnected.</strong></p> <p>Somewhere between the notifications, the obligations, and the performance of being fine, you lost touch with something real.</p> <p>This is the invitation back. Perched above the Pacific in Costa Rica\u2019s blue zone, the Primal Return Retreat is one of Anamaya\u2019s Specialized Retreats \u2013 where the workshops, yoga & activities are included*.</p> <p>7 days of movement, ceremony, breath, and jungle immersion, guided by Sierra Kliscz.</p> <p><strong>Your body already knows it needs this. The only question is whether you\u2019ll say yes.</strong></p>", "padding_y_px": 48}'::jsonb)
