values ('20a00dc7-0432-481d-ac22-4e9e892d9191', 'c229572b-1c0d-446e-8c7c-f05b2852bb92', '{"html": "<p><strong>You weren\u2019t meant to just survive\u2026 you were meant to thrive.</strong></p><p>If you\u2019ve been pouring from an empty cup, feeling drained by the world around you, and craving a deeper connection to yourself, this is your reset.</p><p>Join Terri and Chloe in the lush jungle of Costa Rica for a powerful week of healing, energy alignment, and transformation. Through guided workshops, nourishing practices, and elemental wisdom, you\u2019ll strengthen your boundaries, restore your vitality, and reconnect with the resilient, radiant you.</p><p><strong>This is more than a retreat \u2013 it\u2019s a return to your power.</strong></p><p>Survival of the fittest \u2013 is often understood as a physical concept, but true resilience comes from harmony within the body, mind, and spirit.</p><p>Join Terri & Chloe on a journey of self-discovery, where we cultivate inner strength, balance, and awareness. Through energy work, mindful boundaries, and deep stillness, we will guide you to not just survive, but thrive. Learn to honor your own space, protect your energy, and create boundaries that support your well-being \u2014all while aligning with the natural elements that shape us: <strong>Water, Earth, Ether, Air, and Fire.</strong></p>", "padding_y_px": 48}'::jsonb)
